        The ARN of the Amazon ES domain.  The pattern needs to be arn:.*.  Conflicts with cluster_endpoint.
    domainArnRef : FirehoseAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1DeliveryStreamSpecForProviderOpensearchConfigurationDomainArnRef, default is Undefined, optional
        domain arn ref
